WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.715
The headline numbers: a concordance index of 0.878
at the one-day horizon,

00:00:05.795 --> 00:00:09.082
on a cohort of 30,834 MIMIC-three patients.

00:00:09.162 --> 00:00:15.268
DeepJoint jointly captures three dimensions of
clinical presence, longitudinal,

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:21.141
timing, and missingness, alongside survival, across
horizons of one, seven,

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:22.550
and fourteen days.
